      "content": "hey, i've been having some really bad burning when i pee and a lot of pressure in my pelvis for the last two days. i really dont want to go to the doctor and get a prescription for antibiotics if i can help it. do u think taking really high doses of oregano oil or concentrated cranberry extract would be enough to clear it up before it gets worse? i heard they can kill bacteria too",
